; variations.pgn — bundled famous-game illustrations for opening variations.
; See README.md in this folder for format and contribution guidance.
;
; The non-standard tag [VariationSlug "..."] indexes each game to its
; variation in openings_catalog.py. Games marked [Truncated "true"]
; show only the opening phase or first part of the game; the result
; tag still reflects the actual game outcome, but the moves stop
; before the final position. The UI labels truncated games clearly.
;
; All move lists in this file are validated at startup by
; variations_pgn._load(); illegal or partially-parsed games print a
; warning and are skipped, never crash.

